{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0845"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge sport-games/ball-sports","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/sport-games__ball-sports.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",641],["+"," Croquet, the Victorian lawn game in which balls are struck with wooden mallets through hoops, has strokes of its own: the roquet, when a player's ball hits another, and the croquet stroke that follows, played with the two balls touching. Croquet was even on the programme of the Olympic Games in Paris in 1900 – its only Olympic appearance."],["=",343],["+","croquet | roquet, croquet stroke |\n| "],["=",29]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",607],["+"," Krocket, das viktorianische Rasenspiel, bei dem Kugeln mit Holzhämmern durch Tore geschlagen werden, hat eigene Schläge: das Roquet, wenn die eigene Kugel eine andere trifft, und den anschließenden Krocketschlag mit den beiden sich berührenden Kugeln. Krocket stand sogar bei den Olympischen Spielen 1900 in Paris auf dem Programm – sein einziger olympischer Auftritt."],["=",333],["+","Krocket | Roquet, Krocketschlag |\n| "],["=",29]]}]},
